::ILANG [TYPE:config][PROJECT:vps-deals][LANG:zh]
::STATE{@SITE|brand:VPS Deals|niche:VPS and cloud hosting offers|domain:https://vps-deals-promo-radar-7iu.pages.dev|locale:en-US|update_hours:6}

::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:只读公开的官方来源；改这里后抓取和页面都会变}
::PROVIDER{id:digitalocean|name:DigitalOcean|home:https://www.digitalocean.com/|source:https://www.digitalocean.com/solutions/small-business-website-hosting|pattern:with (?P<credit>\$[\d,]+) in free credit|offer_type:signup_credit|eligibility:Check the official page for eligibility}
::PROVIDER{id:vultr|name:Vultr|home:https://www.vultr.com/|source:https://docs.vultr.com/platform/create-an-account|pattern:free credits for up to (?P<duration>\d+ days)|offer_type:signup_credit|eligibility:New accounts; payment method required}
::PROVIDER{id:hostinger|name:Hostinger|home:https://www.hostinger.com/vps-hosting|source:https://www.hostinger.com/coupons|pattern:|offer_type:monitor_only|eligibility:Check official page for current VPS terms}

::MODULE{FIELDS|title:只存抓到的字段}
  id provider_id title credit duration offer_url source_url fetched_at eligibility
  price currency valid_until 仅在源页明确给出并可验证时写入

::MODULE{RENDER|title:生成静态页面}
  index provider deal compare sitemap robots
  每条优惠显示来源、抓取时间、适用条件；无活动的厂商仍有来源页
  仅带已验证价格的优惠才输出含 price 的 Offer JSON-LD

::RULE{更新频率:6小时；抓取失败或匹配不到⇒该优惠不再展示为当前活动}
::RULE{robots.txt 不允许或读取失败⇒跳过，不绕过限制}
::RULE{valid_until 已过⇒下架；无截止日期⇒不填写}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 品牌词竞价 cookie注入 自买自推|scope:permanent}
